  "details": "After not getting a few friend requests, I took a peek at the log file to see if I can figure out what the problem was and I saw the message:\n\n\"Discarding incoming notification because the user is not in an appropriate state to receive it: <friend request>\"\n\nThen the next lines are immediately deleting the friend request.\n\nI'm in red status, and according to the log file I have streamer mode off:\n\n\"Streamer mode enabled: False\"\n\nIs there anything else that could be causing this, or is it a new bug?",
